                    <Value>Observations:
-The number of uncompleted check reads in PC2 has shown a slight decrease from the previous month.
-The percentage of estimated reads in both PC1 has shown a slight increase in February compared to the previous months, whilst PC2 has shown a decrease. Both will continue to be monitored..</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
